# Dockerfile-specific ignore rules. Never copy local credentials into QA images.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env*
**/.ssh
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/.pnpm-store
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/dump*.sql
**/*.backup
**/*.dump
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
